      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Has suffering become an ugly word in the normalization debate? Are the disabled and their families forced into a Pollyanna culture in order to be acknowledged and accepted in good company as the worthy disabled? This essay poses a controversial question: I would like to start a debate and ask whether normalization also has an unseen, ideological downside."},
